#. Story-only instructions for exercising Composer clipboard failure feedback
#: src/storybook/composer/ClipboardFailurePreview.tsx:27
msgid "A Skill node is selected. Press Cmd/Ctrl+C or X. This story makes document.execCommand('copy') return false. The Composer displays a failure toast and preserves the content. Switching stories restores the browser method."
msgstr "已选中一个 Skill 节点。请按 Cmd/Ctrl+C 或 X。此 Story 让 document.execCommand('copy') 返回 false。Composer 会显示失败提示并保留内容。切换 Story 后会恢复浏览器方法。"

#. Insert fictional files and a PNG together through the Composer file input
#: src/storybook/composer/ComposerAttachmentsPreview.tsx:203
msgid "Add mixed sample"
msgstr "添加混合示例"

#. Insert a fictional local file through the Composer file input
#: src/storybook/composer/ComposerAttachmentsPreview.tsx:211
msgid "Add sample file"
msgstr "添加示例文件"

