#: src/storybook/shared/ShortcutInstructions.tsx:27
msgid "Click inside the preview before pressing keys. This story waits for manual input. Local simulation only; reload or restart to restore the preset. Safari system shortcuts, native focus and real IME behavior require separate manual acceptance."
msgstr "按键前请先点击预览区域。本场景等待手动操作，仅进行本地模拟；刷新页面或重新开始演示可恢复预设状态。Safari 系统快捷键、原生焦点和真实输入法行为需要另行手动验收。"

#. Storybook instructions for retrying an attachment preview; DEV refers to the simulation controls
#: src/storybook/composer/ComposerAttachmentsPreview.tsx:178
msgid "Click the attachment's retry preview icon, then use the DEV controls to complete the preview or simulate another read failure or a decode failure. The failure message remains visible while retrying; the upload status and eligibility to send remain unchanged."
msgstr "点击附件的重试预览图标，再通过 DEV 控制区完成预览、模拟再次读取失败或解码失败。重试期间保留失败提示，上传状态与发送资格不变。"

