#: src/storybook/composer/ComposerAttachmentsPreview.tsx:171
msgid "Files stay in this browser. Uploads are simulated; sending leaves the draft unchanged and never contacts a model."
msgstr "文件仅保留在此浏览器中。上传为本地模拟；发送操作保留草稿，不会联系模型。"

#: src/storybook/appShell/ShortcutFocus.stories.tsx:28
msgid "Focus Menu, then press the shortcut. Focus moves into the editable Composer with a visible focus frame. When the input is unavailable or this page has no Composer, focus stays on Menu."
msgstr "先将焦点移到“菜单”，再按快捷键。焦点会移入可编辑的消息输入框，并显示焦点边框。当输入不可用或页面没有消息输入框时，焦点保留在“菜单”上。"

#: src/storybook/composer/ShortcutGuide.stories.tsx:21
msgid "Focus the input and press Command+Enter. During a running turn, the draft becomes a Guide message. Use the simulated guide response and runtime confirmation to observe completion; a separate later draft is retained. Empty input with an ordinary queue promotes its first message to Guide even though the Guide button is disabled. Empty input without a queue, no active turn, unavailable input, or a recovery blocker does not submit. Hover or Tab to Guide to inspect its Tooltip. On Safari, check real IME composition and the immediate post-composition Enter separately; this story uses the production runtime guard."
msgstr "将焦点移入输入框并按 Command+Enter。轮次运行时，草稿会成为引导消息。通过模拟引导响应和运行时确认观察完成过程；随后另行输入的草稿会被保留。输入为空且普通队列有消息时，即使“引导”按钮不可用，也会将队首消息提升为引导消息。输入为空且没有队列、没有运行中的轮次、输入不可用或恢复流程阻止提交时，均不会提交。悬停在“引导”上或用 Tab 聚焦它可查看提示。在 Safari 中，请分别验证真实输入法组合输入及组合输入刚结束后的 Enter；本场景使用产品运行时的防护逻辑。"

#: src/storybook/composer/ShortcutSend.stories.tsx:17
msgid "Focus the input. Enter sends the prepared text once and clears the draft; Shift+Enter inserts a newline at the caret without sending. Empty or whitespace-only input does not send. Unavailable input cannot be edited or sent. During a running turn, Enter adds an ordinary queued message. Hover or Tab to Send to inspect its Tooltip. Simulation controls can advance the response and runtime confirmation. On Safari, confirm real IME candidates: composing Enter and the immediate post-composition Enter must not send."
msgstr "将焦点移入输入框。Enter 将准备好的文本发送一次并清空草稿；Shift+Enter 在光标处换行，不会发送。空输入或仅有空白字符时不会发送。输入不可用时不能编辑或发送。轮次运行时，Enter 会添加一条普通队列消息。悬停在“发送”上或用 Tab 聚焦它可查看提示。模拟控件可推进响应和运行时确认。在 Safari 中，请通过真实输入法确认候选词：组合输入期间及组合输入刚结束后的 Enter 均不得触发发送。"

#: src/storybook/appShell/ShortcutFocus.stories.tsx:22
msgid "Focus the message input or Menu button, then toggle the menu. Keyboard opening shows one themed close-button ring; mouse opening is the comparison. Escape or the shortcut closes the menu and restores focus. Hover or Tab to Menu to inspect its Tooltip."
msgstr "将焦点移到消息输入框或“菜单”按钮，再切换菜单。使用键盘打开时，关闭按钮应显示一圈符合主题的焦点提示；可用鼠标打开进行对照。Escape 或同一快捷键可关闭菜单并恢复焦点。悬停在“菜单”上或用 Tab 聚焦它可查看提示。"

#. Explains that only post-move page reads are injected in this Story
#: src/storybook/composer/pendingInput/reordering/PendingInputReorderingPreview.tsx:95
msgid "Injected feedback: the first move changes the real queue, then its refreshed list cannot load. Close and reopen the queue to read the updated order."
msgstr "注入反馈：首次移动会改变真实队列，但刷新后的列表无法加载。关闭并重新打开队列可查看更新后的顺序。"

#. Explains the bounded role-interface failure in the queue sorting Story
#: src/storybook/composer/pendingInput/reordering/PendingInputReorderingPreview.tsx:90
msgid "Injected feedback: the first move is rejected without changing the queue. Later moves use the real queue."
msgstr "注入反馈：首次移动被拒绝，队列保持不变。后续移动使用真实队列。"

#: src/storybook/appShell/ShortcutTasks.stories.tsx:21
msgid "K selects the previous task; J selects the next. The displayed order is Shell task one, Shell task 2, Shell task 3. Initially task one is selected: previous wraps to task 3; next selects task 2. Keep typing separate drafts to check retention. With one task, navigation stays on that task; with none, it does nothing. From History, cycling starts from the last viewed task (task one), not from the page route. Held keys and composition do not switch."
msgstr "使用带 K 的快捷键选择上一个任务，带 J 的快捷键选择下一个任务。显示顺序为 Shell task one、Shell task 2、Shell task 3。初始选中第一个任务：上一个会循环到任务 3，下一个会选择任务 2。分别输入草稿以检查切换后的保留情况。仅有一个任务时仍停留在该任务；没有任务时不执行操作。在“历史”页面中，切换从上次查看的任务（第一个任务）开始，而非当前页面路由。长按按键或进行输入法组合输入时不会切换。"

#: src/storybook/composer/ComposerDraftPreview.tsx:74
msgid "Leaving keeps the saved draft. Restarting resets it. Finish simulated sending and save changes before leaving."
msgstr "离开会保留已保存的草稿，重新开始则会重置草稿。离开前，请完成模拟发送并保存修改。"

